# Draft: win32u: Introduce an GLForceCompat option to force compatibility profiles.
# https://gitlab.winehq.org/wine/wine/-/merge_requests/11295 state=closed
# On macOS context sharing is strongly coupled with macOS CGL profiles,
and creating contexts will fail if the internal shared contexts use a
different profile.

This option enables per-application setting to force all internal and
application contexts to use compatibility profile and work with each
other. We then assume core profiles for every other case on macOS.
